(7158135, 1098497, 97225, '<td valign="top">Although her body is visible her head looks strangely detached to me - almost as though she has poked it through a picture.</td>', 'Although her body is visible her head looks strangely detached to me - almost as though she has poked it through a picture.', '2014-01-15 21:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7158142, 1098395, 10785, '<td valign="top">You have a very good portrait here. I think you can improve it be getting a little closer to create a bit more of an intimate environment. This woul look really good cropped in a bit.</td>', 'You have a very good portrait here. I think you can improve it be getting a little closer to create a bit more of an intimate environment. This woul look really good cropped in a bit.', '2014-01-15 21:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
