(7158191, 1098681, 83313, '<td valign="top">I wonder if anyone will guess this as my entry? One of my own regular subjects and a treatment similar to my work. I can''t not like this. Could be <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=117534" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">littlemav</a>.</td>', 'I wonder if anyone will guess this as my entry? One of my own regular subjects and a treatment similar to my work. I can''t not like this. Could be  littlemav.', '2014-01-16 00:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7158243, 1097677, 58667, '<td valign="top">I''m obviously not creative enough. I can''t see how this meets the challenge.</td>', 'I''m obviously not creative enough. I can''t see how this meets the challenge.', '2014-01-16 02:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7158260, 1098432, 58667, '<td valign="top">That''s going to leave a serious burn!</td>', 'That''s going to leave a serious burn!', '2014-01-16 03:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7158264, 1098513, 58667, '<td valign="top">This to me is the perfect entry for this challenge - the subject is doing what his environment is explaining and is engaging the photographer. The photo also tells a good story, but also defines the subject well.</td>', 'This to me is the perfect entry for this challenge - the subject is doing what his environment is explaining and is engaging the photographer. The photo also tells a good story, but also defines the subject well.', '2014-01-16 04:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7158265, 1098619, 58667, '<td valign="top">The angle on this is excellent!</td>', 'The angle on this is excellent!', '2014-01-16 04:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7158266, 1098713, 58667, '<td valign="top">If that had been my study station, I would have been fast asleep. :)</td>', 'If that had been my study station, I would have been fast asleep. :)', '2014-01-16 04:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7158267, 1098442, 58667, '<td valign="top">The saturation on this is very high for my taste, but the photo is excellent!</td>', 'The saturation on this is very high for my taste, but the photo is excellent!', '2014-01-16 04:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7158268, 1097742, 58667, '<td valign="top">This is really effective.</td>', 'This is really effective.', '2014-01-16 04:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7158269, 1098272, 58667, '<td valign="top">This is a good portrait. I like the colours (very natural). For me, however, there is little information about the subject''s environment. I feel for this type of photo in this challenge, the environment should explain who the person is, rather than the title telling. But still, a very good portrait (to me)!</td>', 'This is a good portrait. I like the colours (very natural). For me, however, there is little information about the subject''s environment. I feel for this type of photo in this challenge, the environment should explain who the person is, rather than the title telling. But still, a very good portrait (to me)!', '2014-01-16 05:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7158270, 1097665, 58667, '<td valign="top">This certainly evokes emotion!</td>', 'This certainly evokes emotion!', '2014-01-16 05:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7158272, 1097938, 58667, '<td valign="top">For me, nothing is properly in focus. Also, there is no clear subject (as I would expect in a portrait). I thus can''t find how this relates to the challenge. The photo itself also does not appeal to me greatly (although an interesting scene), mostly due the photographic quality (which I expect from a photo in this style).</td>', 'For me, nothing is properly in focus. Also, there is no clear subject (as I would expect in a portrait). I thus can''t find how this relates to the challenge. The photo itself also does not appeal to me greatly (although an interesting scene), mostly due the photographic quality (which I expect from a photo in this style).', '2014-01-16 05:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7158274, 1097945, 58667, '<td valign="top">This certainly is an interesting take on the challenge. It seems too much of a stretch for me. For me, a portrait needs a clear subject (and for environmental, the subject needs to be defined by the environment). For example, if this was on a hiking trail, then the hiking boots would define the front pair of legs as the subject and be the subject''s defining feature.<br/> <br/>Still, this is an interesting angle and an interesting piece of art. Not too much appealing to me (I wouldn''t put this up on my wall), but interesting.</td>', 'This certainly is an interesting take on the challenge. It seems too much of a stretch for me. For me, a portrait needs a clear subject (and for environmental, the subject needs to be defined by the environment). For example, if this was on a hiking trail, then the hiking boots would define the front pair of legs as the subject and be the subject''s defining feature. Still, this is an interesting angle and an interesting piece of art. Not too much appealing to me (I wouldn''t put this up on my wall), but interesting.', '2014-01-16 05:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7158276, 1098534, 58667, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if some editing was done to get the face or if the face is coincidental. It does look edited to me. That aside, if the subject is the wave, then I suppose the rocks explain a lot.</td>', 'I''m not sure if some editing was done to get the face or if the face is coincidental. It does look edited to me. That aside, if the subject is the wave, then I suppose the rocks explain a lot.', '2014-01-16 05:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7158277, 1098392, 58667, '<td valign="top">I must honestly say that this seems a stretch to me. It is a lovely photo though.</td>', 'I must honestly say that this seems a stretch to me. It is a lovely photo though.', '2014-01-16 05:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7158278, 1098497, 58667, '<td valign="top">I sort of get the idea. The focus could have been sharper (in my taste), and the on-camera flash is not flattering at all - the shadow under the chin hides the true shape of the subject. I believe a more effective B&amp;W conversion could have made this stand out more. The pose is nice and the short focal length is unconventional (but specific and intentional, which is good).</td>', 'I sort of get the idea. The focus could have been sharper (in my taste), and the on-camera flash is not flattering at all - the shadow under the chin hides the true shape of the subject. I believe a more effective B&W conversion could have made this stand out more. The pose is nice and the short focal length is unconventional (but specific and intentional, which is good).', '2014-01-16 05:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7158280, 1097769, 58667, '<td valign="top">Can''t believe people still vote for this guy, let alone wear a picture of his face on their shirts! I honestly would only have a picture of this thief in my house if it was printed on my toilet paper.</td>', 'Can''t believe people still vote for this guy, let alone wear a picture of his face on their shirts! I honestly would only have a picture of this thief in my house if it was printed on my toilet paper.', '2014-01-16 05:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7158282, 1098072, 58667, '<td valign="top">Fantastic interaction! :)</td>', 'Fantastic interaction! :)', '2014-01-16 05:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7158283, 1097886, 58667, '<td valign="top">I love how this defines the shopper. The only thing I don''t like is the heavy sharpening. Still a high vote from me.</td>', 'I love how this defines the shopper. The only thing I don''t like is the heavy sharpening. Still a high vote from me.', '2014-01-16 05:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7158286, 1098466, 58667, '<td valign="top">This is certainly not a style (which I can''t minus for) I take to easily, but the photo itself is great! Having said that, this photo in this style works beautifully! I think this is really really good in this challenge - unconventional, but very creative and unique. I hope this does very well!</td>', 'This is certainly not a style (which I can''t minus for) I take to easily, but the photo itself is great! Having said that, this photo in this style works beautifully! I think this is really really good in this challenge - unconventional, but very creative and unique. I hope this does very well!', '2014-01-16 05:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7158363, 1097946, 174090, '<td valign="top">I like the title/poem/criticism-on-modern-culture. It''s even better than the photo. I like the placement of the remote control though  just within in reach.</td>', 'I like the title/poem/criticism-on-modern-culture. It''s even better than the photo. I like the placement of the remote control though  just within in reach.', '2014-01-16 11:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
