(7158425, 1098520, 152252, '<td valign="top">I love it! His expression is priceless. Was it posed? If yes than he is really good at drifting away with his thoughts - or at least looking like he is far far away :) that knife amazing touch - makes one think what he is thinking so deeply about. And I love the pp.</td>', 'I love it! His expression is priceless. Was it posed? If yes than he is really good at drifting away with his thoughts - or at least looking like he is far far away :) that knife amazing touch - makes one think what he is thinking so deeply about. And I love the pp.', '2014-01-16 15:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7158471, 1097945, 16148, '<td valign="top">Really nice framing!  The contrasting footwear, text on the bag, and the vertical line from pole to shadow of the leg make this very engaging.</td>', 'Really nice framing!  The contrasting footwear, text on the bag, and the vertical line from pole to shadow of the leg make this very engaging.', '2014-01-16 16:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
