(7159857, 1097971, 174126, '<td valign="top">Good contrast in nice B&amp;W shot, probably missing more context to look like a bike shop.</td>', 'Good contrast in nice B&W shot, probably missing more context to look like a bike shop.', '2014-01-19 17:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
